        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='14'>Partial Fulfilled orders: how does retention vary after getting an order which is partially fulfilled?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='8'>* Only showing top 5 chains w/Pelican in Taiwan, Thailand, Argentina, Chile, Kuwait and UAE.</run>
          </formatted-text>
